 with assistant directors, actors, and department heads."}, {"id": "760824b3-1304-427f-88ef-715e4d23d3fc", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Safety and professional conduct", "children": [{"id": "cbe1b39c-4472-4520-95be-8e247531f0f6", "type": "concept", "title": "Intimacy and stunt protocols"}, {"id": "8e2a4e98-a705-46e7-b399-daa8f063fec0", "type": "concept", "title": "Fatigue"}, {"id": "3db4c67e-3dac-4af1-9f7e-45489509f0b3", "type": "concept", "title": "Equipment awareness"}, {"id": "52679eff-451d-497c-ac65-802c838478f8", "type": "concept", "title": "Harassment prevention"}], "description": "The course treats safety as a creative condition, not an administrative afterthought."}, {"id": "87ca2ce4-ef70-4992-b7f4-5a89857f9d23", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Adaptive problem-solving", "children": [{"id": "b6e8eebd-815d-42b3-aa75-d01b5883b208", "type": "concept", "title": "Triage"}, {"id": "0459190e-cecf-4208-9ca1-918bce36bd96", "type": "concept", "title": "Alternative coverage"}, {"id": "4ae2ad4c-1f96-4687-bdfa-b4c90b421778", "type": "concept", "title": "Performance resets"}, {"id": "68c665d7-bd3c-4ddd-8fdb-18aea73de434", "type": "concept", "title": "Creative compromise"}], "description": "Students learn to preserve the heart of the scene when weather, time, performance, or logistics change."}]}, {"id": "53db22a6-f7b7-47cc-8e21-9050cd2c6310", "type": "topic", "title": "Coverage, Continuity, Scene Construction, and Shooting Strategy", "description": "Coverage is not just quantity; it is the director's plan for how a scene will be built in the edit.", "children": [{"id": "3b1fe83f-4354-4e6e-84dd-f29b5d178b43", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Coverage logic", "children": [{"id": "d674762e-26af-4442-a8c2-8e7638d83869", "type": "concept", "title": "Masters"}, {"id": "f48b2f4d-71be-452d-86e6-65bd2e7fc84e", "type": "concept", "title": "Singles"}, {"id": "cd6bc85e-17f1-4679-bead-c694f9e24e02", "type": "concept", "title": "Inserts"}, {"id": "f3a594d4-06fc-4dd7-92c4-82517f4f1afd", "ty