ft, and reflection.", "children": [{"id": "e28af527-4c78-4f94-80d9-a615fc9ed4ed", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Capstone production", "children": [{"id": "a248d2f5-6aa4-449e-a4d7-0e149432ec4a", "type": "concept", "title": "Director's packet"}, {"id": "87b5d0f3-93d6-4839-b40a-dbf24c4c7d73", "type": "concept", "title": "Casting"}, {"id": "38dda5a5-fe71-4e79-9804-2ffe79b32e9e", "type": "concept", "title": "Production"}, {"id": "37e51f9c-bab0-4b45-b43a-a56ed42795a1", "type": "concept", "title": "Final cut"}], "description": "Students synthesize script analysis, actors, visual design, set leadership, and post-production in one finished work."}, {"id": "8b931044-dfc6-4638-b229-eb4cf642a643", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Public screening and critique", "children": [{"id": "5f6dee80-05f1-4f47-8d41-3be221997171", "type": "concept", "title": "Screening notes"}, {"id": "bbacea66-e8cf-49d9-bd99-262075f0433a", "type": "concept", "title": "Artist statement"}, {"id": "10da7215-f1aa-4606-ab1f-9660761451d5", "type": "concept", "title": "Q&A"}, {"id": "bcb8479f-251b-4f0b-bda1-0af0df3b2c86", "type": "concept", "title": "Audience response"}], "description": "The final project becomes a public communication event with feedback, context, and revision thinking."}, {"id": "84e4c049-ad59-4db7-8cc3-bdb6c09e94b2", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Professional pathways", "children": [{"id": "d7db5d7f-2d00-4233-ab71-a24278d610af", "type": "concept", "title": "Director reel"}, {"id": "7923111c-c6e1-4e02-b15f-6f715a9a174c", "type": "concept", "title": "Festival submissions"}, {"id": "65cb46e3-8bbc-486d-b5ea-e6517e782036", "type": "concept", "title": "Networking"}, {"id": "2cc6c448-bede-4d81-a5f4-39bf03950a9b", "type": "concept", "title": "Next project plan"}], "description": "Students learn how emerging directors position their work for festivals, labs, crews, and future collaborations."}]}], "dbBacked": true}$fdirjson$::jsonb,
